OL,3,CMurder arrest after woman's sudden
OL,4,Cdeath
OL,6,FPolice are appealing for information
OL,7,Ffollowing the sudden death of a 60-
OL,8,Fyear-old woman in Cross Hands.
OL,10,FDyfed-Powys Police say they were
OL,11,Fcalled around 7:10pm on Friday, August
OL,12,F14 by the Welsh Ambulance Service
OL,13,Ffollowing the death of a 60 year-old
OL,14,Fwoman at a property in Llandeilo Road.
OL,16,FThe force says an investigation has
OL,17,Fbeen launched to determine the
OL,18,Fcircumstances of her death, which is
OL,19,Fcurrently being treated as suspicious.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/4
