OL,3,CMurder arrest after woman's sudden
OL,4,Cdeath
OL,6,FOne man, aged 63 was arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder and has since been
OL,8,Fbailed.
OL,10,FHer next of kin have been informed and
OL,11,Fare being supported by specialist
OL,12,Fofficers.
OL,14,FDetective Chief Inspector Rebecca
OL,15,FThomas said: "First and foremost, my
OL,16,Fthoughts are with the family at this
OL,17,Fvery difficult time.
OL,26,@wD@NOU
