OL,3,CMurder arrest after woman's sudden
OL,4,Cdeath
OL,6,F"Officers have been present conducting
OL,7,Finvestigation enquiries in the area
OL,8,Fand understandably I recognise this
OL,9,Fmay have caused concern within
OL,10,Fcommunity.
OL,12,F"This is an isolated incident, with no
OL,13,Fwider concern for the safety of the
OL,14,Fpublic. The local community will
OL,15,Fcontinue to see an increased officer
OL,16,Fpresence whilst are our investigation
OL,17,Fis underway.
